==English==

===Etymology===
{{suffix|snakefl|y}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun|snakeflies}}

# Any insect of the order [[Raphidioptera]].
# A hybrid species created when a snake and a fly mate (most often, when a male [[rattlesnake]] reproduces with a female [[fruit fly]])

